{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04264","headline":"晚泊河曲 · 骆宾王","name":"晚泊河曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三秋倦行役，千里泛归潮。\n通波竹箭水，轻舸木兰桡。\n金堤连曲岸，贝阙影浮桥。\n水净千年近，星飞五老遥。\n叠花开宿浪，浮叶下凉飙。\n浦荷疎晚菂，津柳渍寒条。\n恓惶劳梗泛，凄断倦蓬飘。\n仙槎不可托，河上独长谣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}